{"about_the_game":"Fight against all humanity in this videogame where you are the villain. You are an alien with superpowers sent to earth to prepare the conquest of the planet. Your first target is Brimir, one of the most advanced nations on earth. If they cannot fight against you, no other country can.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible level</h2>Make them feel your power, destroy them and turn all their buildings into rubble.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/9cce43492e318823184d57205d35645f.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/9cce43492e318823184d57205d35645f.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/9cce43492e318823184d57205d35645f.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can use your different skills to destroy the map in incredible ways.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Siege</h2>Explore the world as you wish and the end goal is to defeat all human forces from Brimir. You will have to get stronger and improve your skills in order to accomplish your goal.<br>The army might seem weak, but enough of them will make you suffer.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/139b30eb4ca59590a6127722e28985ec.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/139b30eb4ca59590a6127722e28985ec.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/139b30eb4ca59590a6127722e28985ec.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/48305489fbccc8e45ddcd576ee09a515.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/48305489fbccc8e45ddcd576ee09a515.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/48305489fbccc8e45ddcd576ee09a515.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arena</h2><br>Play in a small map against some enemies and try to defeat them. Do you want to have a fight against an entire naval force or have an air battle against a complete air squadron, this is your place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/f946ea04f0c40df86902ee947f51e21c.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/f946ea04f0c40df86902ee947f51e21c.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/f946ea04f0c40df86902ee947f51e21c.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/815d344dcf08c47ea8e752acd08bee7a.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/815d344dcf08c47ea8e752acd08bee7a.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/815d344dcf08c47ea8e752acd08bee7a.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your character</h2>You have to become the ultimate conqueror, in order to do that, you will get experience in every battle that you will use to get stronger and unlock powerful skills.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/d19e44da3a1dc4847d9377759f8d3b15.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=326 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1990980?t=1758613183","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1990980?t=1758613183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758613183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758613183","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contain some violent scene with blood and corpses."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p>Join the discord channel and participate in the creation of this game.<br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Fight against all humanity in this videogame where you are the villain. You are an alien with superpowers sent to earth to prepare the conquest of the planet. Your first target is Brimir, one of the most advanced nations on earth. If they cannot fight against you, no other country can.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible level</h2>Make them feel your power, destroy them and turn all their buildings into rubble.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/9cce43492e318823184d57205d35645f.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/9cce43492e318823184d57205d35645f.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/9cce43492e318823184d57205d35645f.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can use your different skills to destroy the map in incredible ways.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Siege</h2>Explore the world as you wish and the end goal is to defeat all human forces from Brimir. You will have to get stronger and improve your skills in order to accomplish your goal.<br>The army might seem weak, but enough of them will make you suffer.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/139b30eb4ca59590a6127722e28985ec.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/139b30eb4ca59590a6127722e28985ec.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/139b30eb4ca59590a6127722e28985ec.mp4?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/48305489fbccc8e45ddcd576ee09a515.poster.avif?t=1758613183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990980/extras/48305489fbccc8e45ddcd576ee09a515.webm?t=1758613183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour